Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): edit EDM codes through the machine definition

Use edm.codes for MCP machine patches and readback. Validate the code
map before the undoable mount without changing project machine storage.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3212
